  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>PINTU Affiliate Program Terms &amp; Conditions</strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">By participating in the PINTU Affiliate Program, you agree to the following terms.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">1. Enrolment</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Participation requires approval. We reserve the right to accept or reject any application at our discretion.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Affiliate Links &amp; Codes</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates receive unique tracking links and/or discount codes.<br>You are responsible for their proper use and distribution.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">3. Commission</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Commission is earned on valid, completed purchases made through your referral link or code.</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Cancelled, returned, or refunded orders are excluded</p></li><li><p>Commission rates may vary and can be updated at any time</p></li></ul><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">4. Payments</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Commissions are paid monthly in the following month, once the minimum payout threshold is reached.<br>For example, commissions earned in one month will be paid in the next month.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">All payments are made in<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Euro (EUR)</strong>. Any transaction, currency conversion, or transfer fees are the responsibility of the affiliate and will not be covered by PINTU.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Payment details must be provided accurately.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">5. Compliance with Laws</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates must comply with all applicable laws and regulations, including:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><strong>GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Advertising disclosure requirements</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>(e.g. clearly marking content as advertising)</p></li><li><p><strong>Consumer protection laws</strong></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">You are responsible for ensuring that your promotional activities are legally compliant in your country.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">6. Prohibited Activities</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates may not:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Use misleading or deceptive marketing</p></li><li><p>Send spam or unsolicited messages</p></li><li><p>Use unauthorized paid ads or bid on branded keywords</p></li><li><p>Misrepresent PINTU or its products</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Violation may result in immediate termination and forfeiture of commissions.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">7. Intellectual Property</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">All brand assets (logos, images, content) remain the property of PINTU.<br>They may only be used for approved promotional purposes.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">8. Termination</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We reserve the right to terminate participation at any time for violations or other business reasons.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">9. Limitation of Liability</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">To the extent permitted by law, PINTU shall not be liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from participation.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">10. Changes to Terms</span></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We may update these terms at any time. Continued participation constitutes acceptance.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:norma